        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage 13-047, Deadlatch for ND Series</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Schlage ND Series Deadlatch comes standard with a 2-3/4 inch backset. The Latch has a 1/2 inch throw. The faceplate for the 13-047 latch is 1-1/8 inches wide and 2-1/4 inches tall. For use with <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Schlage+ND-\">Schlage's Commercial ND Series levers and knobs</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Replacement latch for Schlage's Commercial ND Series:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Faceplate: 1-1/8” x 2-1/4” square corner</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4” (70 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: 1/2” throw with 1” housing</li> \r\n<li>Meets A156.2 Series 4000, Grade 1 operational requirements.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
